Get app details

Usage: vendo apps get [OPTIONS] <appId>

Arguments:
  <appId>  

Options:
      --json            Output raw JSON
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -h, --help            Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo apps get <appId>
  $ vendo apps get <appId> --json
